b.com/greed-216/histree/blob/ffeb58e6e0fe058df2623e62372c88eca7addd8c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-281/year-0938/part-06/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-077-november/source.txt", "note": "《旧五代史》卷77·晋高祖纪·天福三年十一月，段落 jiu-wudaishi-205deb4a7860-p001921；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "bcc07e25-bf22-5330-b9f9-f6f647d22193"}]'::jsonb)
